```suggestion
// HTML boolean attributes have special behavior:
// we consider the lowercase name to be the only valid value, so
// getting (if the attribute is present) normalizes to that, as does
// setting to any non-`false` value (and setting to `false` removes the attribute).
// See https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-microsyntaxes.html#boolean-attributes
jQuery.each( (
	"checked selected async autofocus autoplay controls defer disabled " +
	"hidden ismap loop multiple open readonly required scoped"
).split( " " ), function( _i, name ) {
```

Note also that our list is outdated; it is missing several boolean attributes from [HTML Attributes](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/indices.html#attributes-3), includes a `scoped` that isn't even present there, and treats [`hidden`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#the-hidden-attribute) as boolean despite the expansion of that attribute to be an enumeration including "until-found" by https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/f5def65bda4d01a6a1e105fcf13fe45201b4f48a .
